msgstr "Cuentamax {source} ukat akar unuqtayatawa. Ukan chhaqtayañkamax mensajenaka ukat yatiyawinakax purap servidoranakar puriraspawa, yaqhip contenidomax nayra servidorat uñacht'ayataskakiniwa, ukat arkirinakamax akan jikxatañatakix mä qawqha minuto munapxaspawa."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx
msgid "Your account will be permanently deleted on {purgeDate}. You've been signed out. To cancel, sign in again before then."
msgstr "Cuentamax {purgeDate} urunx wiñayatak chhaqtayatäni. Mistuyatätawa. Jaytañatakix uka urut nayraqat wasitat mantam."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx
msgid "Your account will be scheduled for deletion and you'll be signed out. You can cancel any time before the deletion date by logging back in. Download your data first if you want to keep a copy."
msgstr "Cuentamax chhaqtayañatakiw wakichatäni ukat mistuyatätawa. Chhaqtayañ urut nayraqat kuna pachas wasitat mantasaw jaytasma. Mä copia imañ munstaxa, nayraqat datonakam apaqam."

#: ../../../lib/web/src/components/comment-composer.tsx
msgid "Your attachments will be lost."
msgstr "Adjuntonakamax chhaqtaniwa."

#: src/features/user/data.tsx
msgid "Your data"
msgstr "Datonakama"

#: src/features/user/data.tsx
msgid "Your data is downloading"
msgstr "Datonakam apaqasiski"

#: src/features/user/data.tsx
msgid "Your private keys are included, encrypted with this passphrase. Store it safely. You'll need it to restore."
msgstr "Privada llawinakamax uchatawa, aka jist'aña arumpi imantata. Suma imam. Kutt'ayañatakix wakisiniwa."

#: ../../../lib/web/src/components/comment-composer.tsx
msgid "Your text and attachments will be lost."
msgstr "Qillqatamasa adjuntonakamasa chhaqtaniwa."

#: ../../../lib/web/src/components/comment-composer.tsx
msgid "Your text will be lost."
msgstr "Qillqatamax chhaqtarakini."
